  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s13/6d2afb4c> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s9/462b3ee3> ;
  triage:notes "AG.11 plus AG.13 Group 1 removed the original production dispatch gap on the corrective line. The finding remains open only because the post-AG.11 validation ladder is still incomplete. USER MANDATE remains: remote-send routing stays behind a tight trait boundary and must not leak general socket logic into unrelated daemon code." .

